    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d78">

                <pb facs="0189" n="83" sameAs="frus:frus1933-39/pg83"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.51W89 U.S.S.R./31: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bullitt</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1934-04-12T13:00:00-05:00">April 12, 1934—1
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>42. Your 50, April 10, 9 p.m. Customs courtesies are being arranged for Rubinin. Department would like to know the
                    purpose of his visit to the United States.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
